EEXXAAMMPPLLEESS
     Use the sound metadriver to load all ssoouunndd bridge device drivers at once
     (for example if it is unclear which the correct driver to use is):

           kldload snd_driver

     Load a specific bridge device driver, in this case the Intel High Defini‐
     tion Audio driver:

           kldload snd_hda

     Check the status of all detected ssoouunndd devices:

           cat /dev/sndstat

     Change the default sound device, in this case to the second device.  This
     is handy if there are multiple ssoouunndd devices available:

           mixer -d pcm1

